      "guid": null,
      "name": "Skeleton Key",
      "slug": "skeleton-key",
      "teaser": "Adds two new items, \"Skeleton Key\" and \"Priority Keycard.\" Unlock any door in the Tarkov region.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2494.png",
      "downloads": 32951,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p>Tired of bringing your Shoreline keys when you went to Customs? If so, this mod is for you.</p>\n<p>Adds two new keys which will open any door in the Tarkov region.</p>\n<p>Adds two new items:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skeleton Key</strong></li>\n<li><strong>TerraGroup Labs priority access keycard</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Currently the only way to obtain them is to buy them from the flea market.<br />\n</strong></p>\n<p><strong>As of version 1.0.1, they now spawn in jackets &amp; bots (pockets &amp; bags), they are very rare.</strong></p>\n<p>The mod has a <strong>config file for adjusting the prices &amp; use count</strong>, but by default are very expensive. From a balancing POV, this mod is probably gonna break the game a bit.</p>\n<p>Have fun!</p>\n<p>If you have any problems or suggestions, feel free to leave a comment.</p>\n<p>If you want to just cheat them in the IDs are</p>\n<ul>\n<li>673e1f10aaf0fe810c488218</li>\n<li>673e213fc6be39d06423d6b7</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1847/skeleton-key",
