          "description": "THIS VERSION IS 3.9\n-------------------\n\nAdditions\n---------\n\n- Added more configuration options regarding drop chance\n\nBalancing Adjustments\n---------------------\n\n- Added a max usage count to the Skeleton Key **(40)** and lowered the price to **30M**\n- Added a max usage count to the Skeleton Keycard **(20)** and lowered the price to **50M**\n- Banned the keys from spawning on Scavs and PMCs, this can be adjusted in the config as well.\n\nOf course, my balancing changes are optional, and you can just set them back in the config.\n\nSet the uses to 0 for unlimited.",
